      "purpose": "Choose the claim boundary",
      "context": "A claim can be taken per attempt or per delivery.",
      "thought": "Per-delivery claims are simpler to reason about on restart; per-attempt claims recover faster but double-book under clock skew.",
      "outcome": "Claim per delivery, with a short renewal window.",
      "rationale": "Simplicity wins while the restart drill is still failing.",
      "next_action": "Classify the responses an attempt can end with.",
